{"slug":"m-w-t","ar":"م و ت","total":165,"core":"death; dying","forms":[{"ar":"مَوْت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":50,"gloss":"death","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":56,"p":5,"ar":["ثُمَّ","بَعَثْنَـٰكُم","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَوْتِكُمْ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَشْكُرُونَ"],"en":"Then We revived you after your death that perhaps you would be grateful"}},{"ar":"مَّاتَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":39,"gloss":"to die","word":null,"ex":{"s":87,"a":13,"p":3,"ar":["ثُمَّ","لَا","يَمُوتُ","فِيهَا","وَلَا","يَحْيَىٰ"],"en":"Neither dying therein nor living"}},{"ar":"مَّيِّت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":38,"gloss":"dead","word":null,"ex":{"s":77,"a":26,"p":2,"ar":["أَحْيَآءً","وَأَمْوَٰتًا"],"en":"Of the living and the dead"}},{"ar":"أَمَاتَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":21,"gloss":"to cause to die","word":null,"ex":{"s":80,"a":21,"p":2,"ar":["ثُمَّ","أَمَاتَهُۥ","فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ"],"en":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him"}},{"ar":"مَيْتَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"dead animal, carrion","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":33,"p":4,"ar":["وَءَايَةٌ","لَّهُمُ","ٱلْأَرْضُ","ٱلْمَيْتَةُ","أَحْيَيْنَـٰهَا","وَأَخْرَجْنَا","مِنْهَا","حَبًّا","فَمِنْهُ","يَأْكُلُونَ"],"en":"And a sign for them is the dead earth. We have brought it to life and brought forth from it grain, and from it they eat"}},{"ar":"مَّيْت","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"dead","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":11,"p":6,"ar":["رِّزْقًا","لِّلْعِبَادِ ۖ","وَأَحْيَيْنَا","بِهِۦ","بَلْدَةً","مَّيْتًا ۚ","كَذَٰلِكَ","ٱلْخُرُوجُ"],"en":"As provision for the servants, and We have given life thereby to a dead land. Thus is the resurrection"}},{"ar":"مَمَات","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"death, dying","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":162,"p":6,"ar":["قُلْ","إِنَّ","صَلَاتِى","وَنُسُكِى","وَمَحْيَاىَ","وَمَمَاتِى","لِلَّهِ","رَبِّ","ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"Say, \"Indeed, my prayer, my rites of sacrifice, my living and my dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds"}},{"ar"